Description: XerahS - Cross-platform screen capture tool
 A modern, cross-platform successor to ShareX.
 .
 This source package installs the official self-contained Linux payload
 from the GitHub release. It is the Launchpad PPA counterpart of the
 XerahS-*-linux-*.deb asset already attached to each release.
 .
 On GNOME, install gnome-shell-extension-appindicator to enable the
 system tray icon.
